        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f0b6538e-f63f-50e3-b0f2-a72c4873ffed",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: A Brilliant Genocide\n- Companies: Atlantic Star Productions\n- Organizations: Government of Uganda, Lord's Resistance Army (LRA)\n- People: Yoweri Museveni, Joseph Kony\n- Places: Uganda\n- Topics: Acholi people, atrocities, rebellion, multi-party democracy, Ten Commandments, Acholi nationalism\n\nFacts:\n- The Lord's Resistance Army was originally known as the United Holy Salvation Army and Uganda Christian Army/Movement.\n- The Lord's Resistance Army stated goals that included establishing multi-party democracy in Uganda, ruling Uganda according to the Ten Commandments, and promoting Acholi nationalism.\n- The Lord's Resistance Army was described in practice as not being motivated by any identifiable political agenda, and its military strategy and tactics were said to reflect that.\n- A Brilliant Genocide is a 2016 documentary film produced by Atlantic Star Productions.\n- A Brilliant Genocide was made to reveal atrocities committed against the Acholi people by the Government of Uganda and President Yoweri Museveni under the guise of crushing a rebellion by Joseph Kony's Lord's Resistance Army.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
